                "Web-Fen WF-6 spinneret B-2 already meters 8.0 kg/h of melt. Die pyrometer "
                "118 C sits 27 K under the 145 C ceiling. Thickness 0.80 mil is a start-up "
                "film, not a hole. Die-first ACCEPT keeps the beam; a gauge-first abort would "
